    "kinds": "contents rows are kind:id:count -- 10 unit, 20 item, 21 equipment, 23 important item, 30 gil, 50 lapis",
    "art": "Shop art from the client's own cache, files/en/sd/static_banner/bundle/ (the 600x120 promos named on the image); Early Bird's (details_banner_earlybird.png) is the 2016 Global datamine image, https://i.imgur.com/8yhkdjc.png, sha256 913efeee22a3b009dc8d9a14b29180425b9422b739c7dff30f6642cb0ff56837 (logs/reference/bundles/sources.md); Iron Chest's was not found. The list tile is a separate 200x200 icon from common_lang/sd/static_banner/bundle/ (same file name as the banner); Early Bird has none, so its `icon` is the game's own lapis chest icon; Iron Chest's is the official 2021 news icon IronChestofAbundanceUpdatedicon.png (400x400, sha256 aa9bcfee..., resized to 200x200; logs/reference/bundles/sources.md).",
    "local_tickets": "990000107-990000112 sell the JP special summons' own ticket items (F_ITEM_MST 106213030-080) for Lapis, prices AUTHORED (Elv 2026-10-24: a local SP ticket source); 990000113 is the JP Super Premium Box (fixed bundle, 10000 Lapis, once), contents from the 2020-05 JP art (research logs/reference/jp_specials/) minus its 3 Vision Cards (no bundle reward kind for cards).",
    "dated": "Bundles with `from`/`until` (Global dates) are sold only in the replay weeks whose slice of history overlaps them (ffbe_player._bundle_on_offer; without the replay, only ones with no `until`). 990000114 sells the Bonus Present Ticket (Global: only in paid chests) for 1000 Lapis from Mar 2021, for the Bonus Present Ticket Summon. 990000115-126 are the twelve Hill of Fortune runs (Apr 2022 - Oct 2023), a paid 29-day login bundle on Global, sold here once per run for 5000 Lapis with all 29 days' rewards at once (operator's request 2026-11-07: a bundle in the store, priced by its contents): Lapis 2500, NRG Restore 10 x30, Expansion Voucher x5, NV EX Tickets (4/5/NV) x6 and (5/NV) x2, King Metal Minituar x10, a Transcension Pearl, four 50% Trust Moogles and five NV Fragment Select Tickets (A Sinister Resurgence, Apr/May 2022) or, from Jul 2022, an NV Guaranteed 10+1 Summon Ticket (only the Apr 2022 and Jul 2022 lists were printed; the later runs reuse the Jul art and are assumed to match). Icons reuse cached ones.",
    "omitted": [
      "Energy rows (Early Bird has none; Iron Chest Energy x70, Bundle of Replenishment Energy x100): stamina refill is not an item the client grants",
      "Iron Chest 'All 5-star awakening materials x20': the wiki does not name which items",
      "Mythril/Gold/Silver Chest of Abundance: the wiki lists prices but no contents",
      "Monthly Special and Today's Special: contents change daily on the server",
      "Unit's Special, event daily specials and past bundles: tied to events that are not running"
    ]
  },
